{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27239","headline":"和滕迈先辈伤马 · 章孝标","name":"和滕迈先辈伤马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮云变化失龙儿，始忆嘶风喷沫时。\n蹄想尘中翻碧玉，尾休烟里掉青丝。\n曾同客舍吞饥渴，久共名场踏嶮巘。\n今日枥前兴一叹，不关行李乏金羁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}